needs:
The rasp of a saw, the fussy cluck and bray
Of hens, the wheeze of a pump, she needs must hear;
She inescapably must endure to feel

needlework:
But tramp and tramp. And yet she knitted hose
Not ill, and was not dull at needlework;
And all the country people gave her pence

needin:
All beat an' cuffed an' clawed an' scratched,
An' needin' both our faces patched,
Each started hum a different way;

neem:
The wild fire-flies
Dance through the fairy neem;
From the poppy-bole
